# series_strong/data/.gitignore
#
# Exclude external data files that are downloaded separately by each
# researcher from canonical sources (see data-README.md in this
# directory for the rationale and download instructions).
#
# These files are NOT distributed with the CPP repository. This .gitignore
# prevents them from being accidentally committed on a subsequent patch.

# AME 2020 atomic mass evaluation (Wang et al. 2021)
ame2020_mass.txt
mass_1.mas20
mass.mas20

# Future: additional external data files should be added here as they
# are adopted by Strong Sector scripts. Keep entries grouped by data
# source (AME, NNDC/ENSDF, etc.) with a comment header identifying
# the source and citation.
